{"id":"n1b5c492195","headline":"Spinach up 120%, cucumber up 80%… 'Heatflation' hits the dinner table","summary":"Record heat and drought have made harvests unstable in South Korea, with spinach prices up 120% and cucumber up 80%. Vegetable prices have more than doubled within a month, raising household food costs.","why":"Food price inflation feeds into headline consumer prices and influences central bank policy. Weather-driven supply shocks can push up grocery costs quickly.","category":"economy","event_type":"macro-data","importance":1,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Seoul","country":"South Korea","lat":37.57,"lon":126.98,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"파이낸셜뉴스","url":"https://www.fnnews.com/news/202608051837431615"},"sources":[{"name":"파이낸셜뉴스","url":"https://www.fnnews.com/news/202608051837431615"}],"published_at":"2026-08-05T09:37:47Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-12T14:14:00Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"5d3f04f210dd4727","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-12T14:14:00Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-08-05T09:37:47Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-08-05T12:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"JA","description_from":"publisher page metadata, translated to English by Claude"},"headline_translated":true,"original_headline":"시금치 120%·오이 80%↑… 밥상 덮친 ‘히트플레이션’","source_language":"kor","image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/wheat-field-harvest-1077839.jpg","alt":"wheat field harvest (illustration)","credit":"josealbafotos","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/monk-pilgrimage-path-sunset-1077839/"}}